", 39.586, 39.676], ["a", 39.676, 39.721], ["duck", 39.721, 40.08], ["he", 40.214, 40.326], ["is", 40.326, 40.453], ["very", 40.453, 40.782], ["proud", 40.782, 41.044], ["of", 41.044, 41.126], ["me", 41.126, 41.32], ["the", 41.506, 41.603], ["only", 41.603, 41.775], ["kid", 41.775, 41.939], ["who", 41.939, 42.029], ["still", 42.029, 42.223], ["does", 42.223, 42.35], ["his", 42.35, 42.462], ["homework", 42.462, 42.784], ["is", 42.784, 42.896], ["kevin", 42.896, 43.255], ["every", 43.401, 43.663], ["night", 43.663, 44.081], ["for", 44.081, 44.216], ["six", 44.216, 44.53], ["years", 44.53, 44.941], ["yesterday", 45.122, 45.653], ["kevin", 45.855, 46.064], ["forgot", 46.064, 46.535], ["just", 46.677, 46.863], ["once", 46.863, 47.23], ["kevin's", 47.412, 47.74], ["full", 47.74, 47.95], ["name", 47.95, 48.151], ["is", 48.151, 48.308], ["mega", 48.308, 48.622], ["kevin", 48.622, 48.966], ["that's", 49.139, 49.296], ["not", 49.296, 49.43], ["an", 49.43, 49.512], ["animal", 49.512, 49.894], ["so", 50.095, 50.23], ["he", 50.23, 50.305], ["turned", 50.305, 50.551], ["into", 50.551, 50.693], ["the", 50.693, 50.783], ["homework", 50.783, 51.224], ["it's", 51.421, 51.571], ["due", 51.571, 51.683], ["friday", 51.683, 52.087], ["and", 52.321, 52.403], ["it's", 52.403, 52.515], ["coming", 52.515, 52.762], ["for", 52.762, 52.919], ["all", 52.919, 53.076], ["of", 53.076, 53.158], ["us", 53.158, 53.375]], "lines": [[0.075, 5.412, "In this town, there's one rule. If you don't do your homework, you turn into an animal that starts with the first letter of your name."], [5.646, 8.015, "My friend Greg skipped spelling. Greg is a goose now."], [8.201, 11.009, "Linda skipped math. Llama. She still can't do fractions."], [11.222, 15.613, "My name is Dave. I checked the list. Dog. Donkey. Duck. I can live with donkey."], [15.923, 18.075, "So I skipped my homework. On purpose."], [18.299, 21.518, "Everyone thought I'd turn into a dog. I didn't. I turned into a dragon."], [21.739, 24.104, "Nobody read the whole list. Dragon starts with D."], [24.249, 26.93, "The teacher said, \"Dave, sit down.\" I sat on the school."], [27.092, 29.659, "Then the whole class figured it out. Nobody did their homework."], [29.866, 35.266, "Tina is a T-rex. Karl is a kraken. We keep him in the pool. Gary is a giraffe. He was hoping for more."], [35.456, 39.014, "The principal called our parents. Our parents are also animals. They went to this school."], [39.228, 41.32, "My dad is a duck. He is very proud of me."], [41.506, 44.941, "The only kid who still does his homework is Kevin. Every night. For six years."], [45.122, 47.23, "Yesterday, Kevin forgot. Just once."], [47.412, 49.894, "Kevin's full name is Mega Kevin. That's not an animal."], [50.095, 51.224, "So he turned into the homework."], [51.421, 53.375, "It's due Friday. And it's coming for all of us."]]}